%% alt: Six steps, top to bottom: use cases, constraints and the quality bar; back-of-the-envelope estimates; a high-level design on the complexity ladder; core components; hardening against injection, leakage and unsafe actions; then scaling and optimising, which loops back to the components whenever a new bottleneck appears.
flowchart TB
  A[1 Use cases, constraints,<br/>quality bar] --> B[2 Back-of-the-envelope]
